DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_collection_activities_ds` contains activity relations pre-filtered to the CNCF collection (slug `cncf`, `cityHash64('cncf') % 10 = 8`, so all its rows live in bucket 8).
    - Populated daily by `cncf_collection_activities_copy.pipe`, which reads from `activityRelations_collection_deduplicated_cleaned_bucket_8_ds` filtered to `collectionSlug = 'cncf'`.
    - Exists so the CNCF report pipes (`collection_contributors_geo_distribution*`, `cncf_country_*`) don't have to scan/filter the full bucket on every request.
    - Stores only the fields those report pipes need: organizationId, memberId, timestamp, platform, type, segmentId.
    - `segmentId` is the project's segment, used by the country report to break contributions down by project.
    - `memberPlace` and `organizationPlace` are the upper-cased country, else location, of the contributor and the organization, copied in so the country report pipes match countries without joining `members_sorted` and `organizations` on every request.
    - `organizationListed` is 1 when the organization can appear in reports: not blocked from affiliations and not the "Individual - No Account" placeholder.

TAGS "Report"

SCHEMA >
    `organizationId` String DEFAULT '',
    `memberId` String DEFAULT '',
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3),
    `platform` LowCardinality(String),
    `type` LowCardinality(String),
    `segmentId` String DEFAULT '',
    `memberPlace` LowCardinality(String) DEFAULT '',
    `organizationPlace` LowCardinality(String) DEFAULT '',
    `organizationListed` UInt8 DEFAULT 0

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYear(timestamp)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY timestamp, organizationId
